            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 尚未連線。請在「設定 › AI 模型」中加入 API 金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t ready" : {
      "comment" : "Model not ready card title. The placeholder is a provider and model, e.g. Google Gemini · gemini-flash.",
